---
// Methodology Component
---
<section id="process" class="py-28 border-t border-slate-900 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-400 mb-3">Our Methodology</h2>
        <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">A rigorous, predictable path to digital excellence.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <!-- Phase 1 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-4">PHASE 01</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Discovery & Strategy</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    We align with your stakeholders, audit existing systems, map out brand positioning, and define clear technical and commercial KPIs for the project.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
                Audits / Brand Positioning / Roadmap
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 2 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-4">PHASE 02</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Architecture & Design</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Our architects and designers map robust cloud infrastructures, design systems, and high-fidelity wireframes optimized for user conversion and system resilience.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
                System Design / UI-UX / Prototyping
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 3 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-4">PHASE 03</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Engineering & Integration</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Rigorous, clean-code development with continuous integration pipelines, stringent security reviews, and seamless third-party API integrations.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
                Full-Stack Build / CI-CD / Security
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 4 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-4">PHASE 04</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Growth & Scaling</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Deployment to resilient cloud environments followed by data-driven growth marketing, technical SEO optimization, and continuous performance tuning.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">
                Deployment / SEO & Growth / Maintenance
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>